  Press Ctrl-C in the second Shell terminal, then run `go run ./local/pdf-catchup` again. That rebuilds with the fixes. Expect to lose about a minute redoing the PDF it was in the middle of.
- ( ) Let it run
  Leave it as it is. If the thumbnail backlog grows, the health monitor shows `thumbnails=` climbing. A page with no picture would stop the run, which wakes me.

